    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Feature Selection\n",
        "\n",
        "In this step, i select the project description column because it contains the most meaningful textual information for semantic similarity analysis."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "oUvycKu187iI"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "ideas = df[\"الوصف\"].tolist()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(ideas[:3])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "N3ujjf4i8-Rz",
        "outputId": "b684b0cb-fa9e-4b7a-dbe8-c1f4d670dbc9"
      },
      "execution_count": 54,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "['تعاني بعض أحياء المدن الكبرى من تأخر اكتشاف الأعطال والمخاطر الميدانية. يقدم المشروع منصة تعتمد على كاميرات الطرق والذكاء الاصطناعي لرصد الحوادث والتلفيات وإرسال تنبيهات فورية للجهات المختصة.', 'يواجه الأفراد صعوبة في تنظيم الالتزامات المالية والادخار. يوفر التطبيق تحليلاً ذكيًا للمصروفات مع خطط ادخار مخصصة وتنبيهات مالية استباقية.', 'يعاني كبار السن من ضعف المتابعة الصحية اليومية. يقدم المشروع سوارًا ذكيًا يراقب المؤشرات الحيوية ويرسل تنبيهات فورية لأفراد العائلة أو الجهات الطبية.']\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Model 1: Bag of Words + Cosine Similarity\n",
        "\n",
        "In this model, i represent each idea using word frequency counts.\n",
        "Then, cosine similarity is used to compare a new idea with existing ideas in the dataset.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "qFojEQXv9As3"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.feature_extraction.text import CountVectorizer\n",
        "from sklearn.metrics.pairwise import cosine_similarity"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ezu9dcCB9C03"
      },
      "execution_count": 56,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "vectorizer = CountVectorizer()\n",
        "\n",
        "X = vectorizer.fit_transform(ideas)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(X.shape)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "R6dgB_kd9HO0",
        "outputId": "385e84ba-a118-4cdd-ebc8-496ceda5ad36"
      },
      "execution_count": 57,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "(3756, 8443)\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "new_idea = [\"ضع فكرتك هنا \"]\n",
        "\n",
        "new_vec = vectorizer.transform(new_idea)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "slXvba2A9IW1"
      },
      "execution_count": 110,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "similarities = cosine_similarity(new_vec, X)\n",
        "\n",
        "max_similarity = similarities.max()\n",
        "\n",
        "novelty = 1 - max_similarity"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "3_KY_4vk9KPT"
      },
      "execution_count": 106,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "def get_novelty_level(novelty):\n",
        "    if novelty < 0.30:\n",
        "        return \"Low Novelty\"\n",
        "    elif novelty < 0.60:\n",
        "        return \"Medium Novelty\"\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        return \"High Novelty\"\n",
        "\n",
        "level = get_novelty_level(novelty)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Model: Bag of Words\")\n",
        "print(\"-------------------\")\n",
        "print(\"Result:\")\n",
        "print(\"Similarity:\", round(max_similarity, 2))\n",
        "print(\"Novelty:\", round(novelty, 2))\n",
        "print(\"Level:\", level)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "vLllyix89Mw4",
        "outputId": "54a40ae0-b190-4cc4-f43e-fdb90bac80fe"
      },
      "execution_count": 107,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Model: Bag of Words\n",
            "-------------------\n",
            "Result:\n",
            "Similarity: 0.15\n",
            "Novelty: 0.85\n",
            "Level: High Novelty\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Model 2: TF-IDF + Cosine Similarity\n",
        "TF-IDF improves text representation by giving higher importance to informative words and reducing the impact of very common words."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xK4vZzCq9P0s"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from sklearn.feature_extraction.text import TfidfVectorizer"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "dEVi9j3P9RF5"
      },
      "execution_count": 65,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "tfidf_vectorizer = TfidfVectorizer()\n",
        "\n",
        "X_tfidf = tfidf_vectorizer.fit_transform(ideas)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(X_tfidf.shape)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "mUcG9Pfy9ggl",
        "outputId": "2c1458ec-f8f5-496d-f526-b252bc43a69b"
      },
      "execution_count": 66,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "(3756, 8443)\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "new_idea = [\"ضع فكرتك هنا \"]\n",
        "\n",
        "new_vec_tfidf = tfidf_vectorizer.transform(new_idea)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "WTK1SPSD9TPm"
      },
      "execution_count": 111,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "similarities_tfidf = cosine_similarity(new_vec_tfidf, X_tfidf)\n",
        "\n",
        "max_similarity_tfidf = similarities_tfidf.max()\n",
        "\n",
        "novelty_tfidf = 1 - max_similarity_tfidf\n",
        "\n",
        "level_tfidf = get_novelty_level(novelty_tfidf)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Model: TF-IDF\")\n",
        "print(\"-------------------\")\n",
        "print(\"Result:\")\n",
        "print(\"Similarity:\", round(max_similarity_tfidf, 2))\n",
        "print(\"Novelty:\", round(novelty_tfidf, 2))\n",
        "print(\"Level:\", level_tfidf)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "4bpDKPCJ9i1A",
        "outputId": "4d304ba1-95ab-4ae9-e1b5-8dcd1ce4a92f"
      },
      "execution_count": 108,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
